			],
			"Message": "Refactor logging and telemetry functions for improved readability and consistency\n\n- Added spacing for better readability in Trace.ts, PostHogBridge.ts, Sandbox.ts, Tier.ts, and WorkbenchIntegrationImplementation.ts.\n- Enhanced error handling and performance measurement in Trace.ts.\n- Updated CaptureEvent and CaptureError functions in PostHogBridge.ts to ensure proper logging.\n- Improved IPCMessage and SandboxNodeProcess interfaces in Sandbox.ts for clarity.\n- Refactored WorkbenchIntegrationImplementation.ts to streamline state updates and debug logging.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
